      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The number in the bottom left indicates your signature. The higher it
    is, the longer the range at which you can be accurately fired upon, or launched
    missiles at. Enemies targeting you will have a red line between them and you.
    The line will be full red if they have an accurate lock. Likewise, their bounding
    box will become opaque if you have an accurate lock on them.


    Facing an
    enemy on most ships will boost the speed and tracking of your guided munitions.


    Turrets
    increase their rate of fire the longer they keep firing at a locked target.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 52e6ae2838f9ff44dbd15175a7f87939, type: 2}
